# Set VITE_API_URL in your Vercel project's Environment Variables (Settings -> Environment
# Variables) to your Render backend origin, e.g. https://muse-backend-xxxx.onrender.com
# A value set in Vercel overrides this file, so the real URL stays out of git.
# No active VITE_API_URL line here on purpose, so the production build never bakes a placeholder.
